
# CashFlow Cynex: Revenue Cycle Dashboard (MySQL + Excel)

CashFlow Cynex is an end-to-end Revenue Cycle Management (RCM) analytics project which turns synthetic healthcare claims data into actionable cash-flow insights using **MySQL** for data modeling and **Excel** for an interactive executive dashboard.

## ✨ Project Highlights

- RCM-focused design: models patients, payers, and claims to mimic a real healthcare revenue cycle environment.
- Strong SQL: MySQL scripts calculate key RCM KPIs with joins, date logic, and aggregations.
- Executive-ready visuals: Excel dashboard with KPI cards, slicers, and dynamic charts branded as CashFlow Cynex.

## 🧱 Tech Stack

- Database: MySQL 8
- Analytics: Excel (PivotTables, charts, conditional formatting)
- Data: Synthetic healthcare claims, patients, and payers (no real PHI). [web:34][web:26]

## 🩺 RCM KPIs

- Days in A/R – average time to collect on claims. [web:7][web:35]  
- Denial rate – percentage of claims and billed amounts denied. [web:7][web:13][web:16]  
- Net collection rate – collections performance after adjustments. [web:7][web:10][web:32]  
- A/R aging – 0–30, 31–60, 61–90, >90 days. [web:7][web:13][web:35]

